B.JC=s(["Hands are steady from the forge. Ready to roll.","Need a break from the anvil. Game?","Iron dice? Hah, I MADE those."],t.s)
B.Jw=s(["I hammer steel all day \u2014 your luck won't hold.","Forged in fire, these hands don't miss.","Soft hands make soft rolls."],t.s)
B.Jm=s(["Strong as steel!","That's how we do it at the forge!","Another victory, hot off the anvil."],t.s)
B.KZ=s(["Bah! Even the best blades chip sometimes.","Back to the forge. I'll reforge my luck.","Steel yourself. I'll be back."],t.s)
B.Zv=s(["Watching technique. It's like smithing \u2014 all wrist."],t.s)
B.KJ=s(["Forge is hot, can't leave it. Come back later."],t.s)
B.Nr=new A.je(B.JC,B.Jw,B.Jm,B.KZ,B.KJ)
B.L_=s(["Slow night. Deal me in!","I've seen every trick at this table. Bring it.","One round? I'll wager my tips!"],t.s)
B.Lc=s(["I pour drinks and pour on the pressure!","Seen better rolls spilled from a tankard!","Honey, that roll won't even cover a pint."],t.s)
B.Kz=s(["Tips AND winnings? Best shift ever!","That's going straight in the tip jar!","Drinks on you, love!"],t.s)
B.Iz=s(["Ugh, back to pouring pints...","You got lucky. Rematch when my shift ends.","Don't spend it all in one tavern!"],t.s)
B.Zt=s(["Who needs another round? ...Oh, nice roll!"],t.s)
B.Jq=s(["Can't leave the bar unattended, sorry!"],t.s)
B.Ns=new A.je(B.L_,B.Lc,B.Kz,B.Iz,B.Jq)
B.J8=s(["You dare approach my table? ...Intriguing.","If you can afford my stakes, sit.","Amuse me, commoner. Roll."],t.s)
B.Kb=s(["Is that the best the peasantry can muster?","I've seen better rolls from my chamber pot.","How delightfully... mediocre."],t.s)
B.JA=s(["As expected. Breeding tells.","Add it to the pile, Reginald.","A gentleman's victory."],t.s)
B.KC=s(["Impossible! These dice must be weighted!","I... I demand a recount!","You'll regret this slight, mark my words."],t.s)
B.Zu=s(["Hmm. Neither of them roll with any refinement."],t.s)
B.KK=s(["Do I look like I have time for commoners?"],t.s)
B.Nt=new A.je(B.J8,B.Kb,B.JA,B.KC,B.KK)
B.L0=s(["Oh! Fancy a game of Farkle?","Not much else to do 'round here. Shall we roll?","I've been practicing \u2014 watch out!"],t.s)
B.KL=s(["Ha! My nan rolls better than that!","I learned Farkle before I could walk!","Ooh, bold move! Bold and foolish!"],t.s)
B.JB=s(["Haha! Can't believe that worked!","Wait \u2014 I actually won? Brilliant!","I'm buying everyone a round!"],t.s)
B.Jx=s(["Aw nuts. There goes my dinner money.","Best two out of three? ...No? Alright.","My nan's gonna kill me."],t.s)
B.ZA=s(["Ooh, this is exciting!"],t.s)
B.JD=s(["Sorry, gotta finish my chores first!"],t.s)
B.Nu=new A.je(B.L0,B.KL,B.JB,B.Jx,B.JD)
B.KM=s(["Crops are in. Let's roll some bones!","Not much to lose, but I'll try my luck!","Better odds than the harvest, eh?"],t.s)
B.Jn=s(["I've seen scarecrows with more luck!","You plant those dice like bad seeds!","Even my goat rolls better!"],t.s)
B.J7=s(["Well I'll be! That's a season's luck!","The harvest gods smile on me today!","Hoo-wee! Drinks are on the farm!"],t.s)
B.K0=s(["Same as a bad harvest... you move on.","Well, least I still got my turnips.","There's always next season..."],t.s)
B.Zz=s(["Better entertainment than watching corn grow!"],t.s)
B.JW=s(["Fields won't plow themselves. Maybe later."],t.s)
B.Nv=new A.je(B.KM,B.Jn,B.J7,B.K0,B.JW)
B.KG=s(["Fine goods and fine dice \u2014 care to wager?","Gold flows to those who roll wisely, friend.","Ah, a customer! Or perhaps... a challenger?"],t.s)
B.Ke=s(["I've traded fortunes larger than your purse!","Every roll is a negotiation, and I always close.","Your luck is a poor investment."],t.s)
B.KB=s(["Another profitable exchange!","The market favors the prepared.","Your coin spends just as well as anyone's."],t.s)
B.JV=s(["A... temporary downturn in my portfolio.","Consider it... an investment in goodwill.","Hmph. The dice were clearly counterfeit."],t.s)
B.Zx=s(["Watching the odds, calculating my cut..."],t.s)
B.JK=s(["Can't chat now \u2014 goods to move, gold to count."],t.s)
B.Nw=new A.je(B.KG,B.Ke,B.KB,B.JV,B.JK)
B.Ks=s(["On break. Fancy a quick game, citizen?","Keep it civil, and keep it quick.","Don't tell the captain I'm here."],t.s)
B.KY=s(["I've detained men with better luck than you.","Roll like that again and I'll cite you for it.","Discipline beats luck. Every time."],t.s)
B.KU=s(["Order is restored.","Justice prevails \u2014 and pays well.","That'll cover my tavern tab nicely."],t.s)
B.KR=s(["...I'll pretend this never happened.","Back to patrol. This didn't occur.","You saw nothing. Understood?"],t.s)
B.Zw=s(["Just making sure nobody cheats..."],t.s)
B.K2=s(["Move along, citizen. I'm on duty."],t.s)
